  m_Name: SpouseHammer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialogue
  npcName: Spouse
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 10913, guid: 0000000000000000f000000000000000, type: 0}
  dialogueLines:
  - You see that hammer over there?
  - That is my most trusted buisness partner.
  - Always reliable, always there.
  - He would never leave me.
  - He would never not work.
  - Thats all he knows.
  - He works, he fixes, he helps
  - He is the tool for other tools.
  - It can't just stop, he wouldn't.
  - He was forced to.
  - That stupid hammer fell of the handle!
  - He turned a tiny broken bone,
  - Severed nerves,
  - And infected scars,
  - into a point of no return.
  - HE LEFT!
  - What is left? A stupid stick and a useless arm.
  - He is useless, with nothing to do.
  - Nothing to help, nothing to fix.
  - He doesnt deserve to be outside.
  - He should be in a cave.
  - Away from the sun and all joy.
